# your own lines go below this one; loom upgrade keeps them
# The showcase commits its store's PDFs, as the demo does and as no quilt of your own should: every cited work here is invented and compiled from LaTeX in this repository, so the bytes are ours to publish, and committing them lets a fresh clone open the viewer with every `cited:` locator resolving to a real page.
!digests/storage/**/paper.pdf
